desc:
One human vs an angry swarm of bees! Can the human finish chores before the hive takes them down?

HOW TO PLAY:
🧔 HUMAN: Complete all your tasks around the garden to win!
🐝 BEES: Coordinate with the swarm to sting the human into submission!

👍 LIKE the game and JOIN the group for updates!

